`server.js`、`ai-workbench.html`、`tests/`、`tools/`、`smoke-*.mjs`、`acceptance*.mjs`、
`agent-trial.mjs`、`run-tests.sh`、`video/src/`、`video/render.mjs`、`video/make-bgm.py`、
`video/tools/`、`video/page.html`、`video/assets/build-assets.py`

## 2. 美术素材 —— 不适用 MIT，禁止商用

Artwork, character designs, backgrounds, button graphics, decorative assets, images, icons,
previews, and their embedded or transformed copies are excluded from MIT. Copyright remains with
the respective rights holders, including original character artists and Small-tailqwq for their
respective contributions. **Artwork includes AI-generated and AI-assisted images. No commercial use
of the artwork is licensed by this repository.** Existing artwork permissions and attribution
requirements remain in effect; see each asset's `NOTICE` and `LICENSE-ARTWORK`. Bundling artwork
into source code, CSS, data URLs, or `lib/` does not change its license.

范围包含但不限于：`video/assets/characters/`、`video/assets/raw/`、`角色定妆板_AI的自白.jpg`、
以及 `video/assets-data.js` 中的内嵌图像，和**成片视频中的画面**。

逐份声明见：
- `video/assets/characters/LICENSE.txt`
- `video/assets/raw/gh/dl/LICENSE_dsh-deep-whale.txt`

